{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c4c246c0-7565-85f5-b7cf-1e3957365425",
  "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:43:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I'm calling about trash on the curb at 15 Ruggles Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:41:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 15 Ruggles. What's out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:41:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A mattress, a couple of chairs, a bunch of bags, some boards. The landlord left it all after the tenants moved out. It's been sitting there since Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:41:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it your building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I run a shop next door. It's in front of my entrance, partly on my side of the walk. I'd like it gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I understand. Hang on, I can barely hear you, is there music on your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Radio in the back room. One second. [pause] Okay, I turned it down. Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better. So bulk items like a mattress usually aren't taken with regular trash unless they've been set up for it. The landlord would normally have to arrange that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He didn't. He just put it out. So when is the next pickup on that street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the route for Ruggles. [pause] It's Friday here, so today's the regular day, but with the nor'easter coming in today, crews may be running late or pushing things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:42:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's pouring now. The pile's getting soaked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:42:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'd expect that. Even if they come, the regular truck probably won't take the mattress and furniture. I can send this over as a complaint about bulk waste left at the curb, and someone can follow up with the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Do that. Is there a name you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, your name and a callback number, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kwame Nguyen. 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Kwame. Fifteen Ruggles Avenue, bulk waste left after a move-out, in front of the shop next door. I'll put a note that it's wet and blocking part of the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's blocking most of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that too. Someone should call you once it's been looked at, but the storm might slow things down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:43:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay dry."
    }
  ],
